OL,3,GNEWSA'I was humiliated,' says
OL,4,Aex-officer in discrimination case, as
OL,5,Achief constable apologises
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe chief constable has apologised to a
OL,8,Fformer PSNI chief inspector for
OL,9,Fdiscrimination she suffered in the
OL,10,Fforce.
OL,12,FIn 2023, an employment tribunal found
OL,13,Fthat Ch Insp Ursula Merrick was
OL,14,Fdiscriminated on grounds of her sex and
OL,15,Fdisability.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
