OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I was humiliated,' says
OL,4,Aex-officer in discrimination case, as
OL,5,Achief constable apologises
OL,6,
OL,7,FUrsula Merrick, who has been medically
OL,8,Fretired, was subjected to "unwarranted
OL,9,Fand highly damaging allegations" by her
OL,10,Fformer colleague, Supt Ian Campbell,
OL,11,Fwho is now retired. Speaking on Monday,
OL,12,Fshe said she had been "humiliated" by
OL,13,Fhis behaviour.
OL,15,FOn Monday, Chief Constable Jon Boutcher
OL,16,Fsaid: "There is and should be no place
OL,17,Ffor behaviour like this in the PSNI. We
OL,18,Fare committed to a workplace culture of
OL,19,Fequality, diversity, and inclusion."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
